'''Adult''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth †]]'', turns Isaac into an adult upon taking three [[Puberty]] pills.

== Effects ==
* Grants one full [[Red Heart container]].
* Makes Isaac's voice deeper.

== Notes ==
* Consuming further Puberty pills has no effect.

== Trivia ==
* This transformation and [[Stompy]] are the only transformations that [[pill]]s count towards.

